    {
      "text": "3.2 hours",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  <br/>According to balanced equation <br/>27.66 g <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> i.e. 1 mole <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub></math> requires 3 mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> . Now this oxygen is produced by electrolysis of water as follows <br/><math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>As 1 mole <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is produced by 4 F charge <br/>So 3 mole <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> will be produced by 12 F charge <br/>So now on applying <br/>Q <math><mo>=</mo></math> It <br/><math><mtext>12</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>965</mtext><mn>00</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>96500</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3600</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> hours <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.2</mn></math> hours"
  }
